 *                             media element will be passed
 *                             in as the argument to the
 *                             callback.
 * @chainable
 * @example
 * <div><code>
 * function setup() {
 *   let audioEl = createAudio('assets/beat.mp3');
 *   audioEl.showControls();
 *   audioEl.onended(sayDone);
